{"book":11,"chapter":18,"rubric":"MODERN FRONTEND / CSS AND LAYOUT","slides":[{"title":"Everything is rectangles","sub":"display: block, inline, inline-block, none","main":"Every element has its own box; display decides how it sits among neighbors.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Rectangles","Block","Inline","Inline-block and none"],"captions":["To the browser everything is rectangles: a button, a word, an image each get a box","A block box takes the full width and pushes neighbors onto a new line","An inline box lives in a line and takes only what its content needs; width and height can't be set","Inline-block sits in the line and obeys sizes, while none removes the element from layout entirely"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":90.0,"h":40.0,"text":"button","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":60.0,"h":40.0,"text":"word","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":285.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":40.0,"text":"image","tone":"violet","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":140.0,"text":"to the browser everything is rectangles","size":10.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":180.0,"y":32.0,"w":300.0,"h":28.0,"text":"<h2>  block","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":72.0,"w":300.0,"h":28.0,"text":"<p>  block","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":180.0,"y":112.0,"w":300.0,"h":28.0,"text":"<ul>  block","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":150.0,"text":"display: block: full width, one under another","size":10.0}],[{"t":"zone","id":"z","x":180.0,"y":72.0,"w":330.0,"h":50.0,"tone":"outline"},{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":56.0,"y":72.0,"w":60.0,"h":26.0,"text":"coffee","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":112.0,"y":72.0,"w":36.0,"h":26.0,"text":"and","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":170.0,"y":72.0,"w":60.0,